{"word":"fetid","translation":"fétido","definition_en":"Having a strong, unpleasant, and offensive smell.","definition_pt":"Ter um cheiro forte, desagradável e ofensivo.","example_en":"The fetid odor from the swamp was unbearable.","example_pt":"O odor fétido do pântano era insuportável.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"general-vocabulary","frequency_rank":null},
