{"word":"fetor","translation":"fedor","definition_en":"A very strong, offensive, and often sickening odor.","definition_pt":"Um odor muito forte, ofensivo e muitas vezes repugnante.","example_en":"The fetor from the garbage dump was unbearable.","example_pt":"O feto do lixo era insuportável.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"noun","category_slug":"general-vocabulary","frequency_rank":null},
