{"word":"grenadian","translation":"granadino","definition_en":"Of or pertaining to the country of Grenada, its people, culture, or characteristics.","definition_pt":"Ou pertencente ao país de Granada, seu povo, cultura, ou características.","example_en":"The Grenadian coastline is famous for its beautiful beaches.","example_pt":"A costa de Grenadia é famosa por suas belas praias.","cefr_level":"B1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"general-vocabulary","frequency_rank":null},
